  "litter_share": "litter / (litter + bare ground), the middles of the component's NRCS ecological site reference sheet ranges (EDIT); else the tile's sheet-weighted mean",
  "ground": "the surface by the sheets (plant canopy, litter, bare ground, crust: range middles, as shares of their sum), weighted by component share; units without a sheet the tile's area-weighted mean",
